        "edit": "In Calculator's posedge clk block, change blocking assignments to nonblocking: moutq = moutq -> moutq <= moutq; moutq = 0 -> moutq <= 0; mf=1 -> mf<=1; moutq = moutq + 1 -> moutq <= moutq + 1; mf=0 -> mf<=0. This aligns sequential state updates with the clock edge and removes the cycle-0 divergence on Q.",
